  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact /Overall Objective: Regional trade liberalization and integration contributes to increased sustainable economic development and reduced poverty in PAFTA countries
Outcome 1: PAFTA Sec. coordinates the PAFTA competently
Output 1.1 PAFTA sec. staff have acquired modern knowledge on customs union affairs from international/regional experts
Output 1.2&#xa0;PAFTA sec. staff have acquired new skills in mediation &amp; management from attending local trainings
Outcome 2:&#xa0;Negotiators &amp;Focal points in LDC&#x2019;s engage on PAFTA with PAFTA Sec. in ways that benefits their country
Output 2.1&#xa0;LAS trade training program is developed tailored to the needs of LDC&#x2019;s FPs and Negotiators
Output 2.2&#xa0;All LDC&#x2019;s FP and Negotiators, have acquired new skills from LAS trade training programs
Output 2.3&#xa0;All PAFTA members engage and network in joint trade negotiation workshops</narrative>
  </description>
